                <pb facs="0222" n="120" sameAs="frus:frus1927v03/pg120"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">865.3311/52: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Italy</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Fletcher</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                    State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Rome</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1927-04-07T12:00:00+01:00"><hi rendition="#italic">April 7,
                                1927—noon</hi></date>.<lb/>[Received 12:29 p.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>47. I have just telegraphed Mussolini expressing regret for the destruction of
                    Pinedo’s airplane. Associated Press will telegraph text.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Fletcher</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
